+```text
+kompile semantic.k --backend llvm --main-module MPY \
+  --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
+  --output-definition audit-semantic-kompiled
+```
+
+It exited 0. The compiler emitted deprecation and zero-argument `symbol`
